{const s=document.querySelector("main .sheet");s.innerHTML="<div class="primer"><div class="opening"><p class="lede">Each step is one small thing to do, and each comes easy once the one before it is done.</p>
<p>Press <a class="inline-try" href="#explorer">Try it</a> beside a step and its room opens already set for that step, so you may begin anywhere and skip whatever you know. Nothing you do there can spoil a world: every world comes back from its number.</p></div><section class="room" id="explorer"><h2 id="explorer-h">The Explorer</h2>
<p class="what">The Explorer draws a whole world from a number, and every control on it reshapes or redresses that world.</p><section class="lesson" id="explorer-number"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> A world from a number<span class="gloss">the seed box, the dice and Draw, at the top right</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step done" id="explorer-dice">
<span class="seal" title="done, kept in this browser">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch glyph">⚄</span>, the dice beside the seed box.</p><p class="see">A whole new world is drawn, and its number fills the seed box.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span><span class="mark">play: no wrong answer</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--dice.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step done" id="explorer-draw">
<span class="seal" title="done, kept in this browser">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Type 42 in the seed box and press <span class="ch btn">Draw</span>.</p><p class="see">The Isle of Rahai comes back, line for line. Every chart is reproducible from the number in its margin.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=7">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--draw.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step done" id="explorer-enter">
<span class="seal" title="done, kept in this browser">3</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Type any number you like in the <span class="ch btn">seed</span> box and press Enter.</p><p class="see">Every number is a world, and the same number is the same world for anyone who types it.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span><span class="mark">play: no wrong answer</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--enter.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="explorer-land"><h3><span class="rn">ii</span> The Land<span class="gloss">these shape the world itself</span></h3><p class="aside">Every list starts at seed's choice: choose it again to hand the row back to the seed.</p><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="explorer-archipelago">
<span class="num">4</span><div class="body"><p class="act">On the Broadside, open <span class="ch word">type</span> and choose <span class="ch opt">archipelago</span>.</p><p class="see">The isle breaks into a scatter of isles, and the chart is renamed The Rahai Archipelago.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--archipelago.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-islands">
<span class="num">5</span><div class="body"><p class="act">A new row has come: drag <span class="ch word">islands</span> from <span class="ch word">few</span> toward <span class="ch word">many</span>, then let go.</p><p class="see">The sea fills with isles, and the readout says about how many. A few may touch or sink, so the count is never exact.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;type=archipelago">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--islands.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-sizes">
<span class="num">6</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Now <span class="ch word">sizes</span> has come too: choose <span class="ch word">of every size</span>.</p><p class="see">Some isles swell and others stay small.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;type=archipelago&amp;islands=20">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--sizes.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-climate">
<span class="num">7</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Open <span class="ch word">climate</span> and choose <span class="ch opt">polar</span>.</p><p class="see">Pine woods and open tundra, and the snow line comes down the hills. The coast stays exactly where it was.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--climate.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-shape">
<span class="num">8</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Type Iceland in the <span class="ch word">shape</span> box, and choose it from the list.</p><p class="see">The land is drawn inside Iceland's outline, north up, nearly edge to edge.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--shape.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-held">
<span class="num">9</span><div class="body"><p class="act">With Iceland still in the box, choose <span class="ch opt">archipelago</span> from <span class="ch word">type</span>.</p><p class="see">The islands row steps into the held box at the foot of the Land, which says why: the outline holds the count; clear the place to free the islands.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;outline=ne-1159320917">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--held.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="explorer-strand"><h3><span class="rn">iii</span> The Strand<span class="gloss">these set the water's edge</span></h3><p class="aside">A row that cannot act on the world on screen waits in a held box, and the note under it says what holds it.</p><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="explorer-sea-level">
<span class="num">10</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Drag <span class="ch word">sea level</span> slowly toward <span class="ch word">more sea</span>.</p><p class="see">The sea rises as you drag, and the readout says how much of the sheet is land.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--sea-level.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-coast">
<span class="num">11</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Drag the <span class="ch word">coast</span> from <span class="ch word">calm</span> toward <span class="ch word">lobed</span>, then let go.</p><p class="see">Nothing moves until you let go; then a new coast is drawn. Each step of the coast is a different world.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--coast.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-ragged">
<span class="num">12</span><div class="body"><p class="act">On a counted archipelago the coast row runs <span class="ch word">round</span> to <span class="ch word">ragged</span>: drag it toward <span class="ch word">ragged</span>, and let go.</p><p class="see">Every island's shore frays.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;type=archipelago&amp;islands=20">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--ragged.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-looseness">
<span class="num">13</span><div class="body"><p class="act">With Iceland's shape on the chart, drag <span class="ch word">looseness</span> from <span class="ch word">exact</span> toward <span class="ch word">loose</span>.</p><p class="see">The land slips its outline toward the seed's own island, and the coast row comes free.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;outline=ne-1159320917">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--looseness.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="explorer-hand"><h3><span class="rn">iv</span> The Hand<span class="gloss">these dress the same world</span></h3><p class="aside">Nothing in the Hand changes the land: the same world, dressed another way.</p><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="explorer-style">
<span class="num">14</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Open <span class="ch word">style</span> and choose <span class="ch opt">ink</span>.</p><p class="see">The same world, drawn again in pen and ink.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--style.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-theme">
<span class="num">15</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Open <span class="ch word">theme</span> and choose <span class="ch opt">rainfall</span>.</p><p class="see">The land is washed with how much rain falls where.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--theme.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-arms">
<span class="num">16</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Tick <span class="ch word">arms</span>.</p><p class="see">Each realm's coat of arms is set on the chart.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--arms.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-beasts">
<span class="num">17</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Tick <span class="ch word">beasts</span>.</p><p class="see">A sea beast is drawn in the deep water with its name beside it: on this chart, Rauhoahai.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--beasts.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-survey">
<span class="num">18</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Tick <span class="ch word">survey</span>.</p><p class="see">The expedition's track is inked onto the sheet, with the ship's daily stations.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--survey.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-legend">
<span class="num">19</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Untick <span class="ch word">legend</span>, then tick it again.</p><p class="see">The key in the corner is taken off, and put back.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--legend.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="explorer-glass"><h3><span class="rn">v</span> The Surveyor's Glass<span class="gloss">the presses at the chart's bottom right corner</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="explorer-nearer">
<span class="num">20</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Draw nearer</span>, the + by the chart.</p><p class="see">The chart comes closer.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--nearer.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-look-about">
<span class="num">21</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Drag the chart to look about it. Or click it, and use the arrow keys.</p><p class="see">The sheet slides under your hand. On the keys, + and − come nearer and stand off, and 0 shows the whole sheet.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--look-about.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-anew">
<span class="num">22</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Keep pressing <span class="ch btn">Draw nearer</span> until the chart is drafted anew.</p><p class="see">A finer survey of that ground is drawn over the chart, with one corner turned up at its top right.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--anew.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-hold">
<span class="num">23</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Hold the sheet</span>, the anchor.</p><p class="see">The Glass drafts no finer survey and takes nothing away while it is lit, so the sheet you have stays put; the caption ends held.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;cx=0.5000&amp;cy=0.5000&amp;k=1.9600">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--hold.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-loupe">
<span class="num">24</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">The loupe</span>, or hold the L key with the chart in hand.</p><p class="see">Move the pointer over the chart: a round lens magnifies whatever lies under it.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;cx=0.5000&amp;cy=0.5000&amp;k=1.9600">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--loupe.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-stand-off">
<span class="num">25</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Stand off</span> to step back, or <span class="ch btn">The whole sheet</span> to see it all again.</p><p class="see">The chart draws back to the whole sheet.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;cx=0.5000&amp;cy=0.5000&amp;k=1.9600">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--stand-off.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-in-hand">
<span class="num">26</span><div class="body"><p class="act">On a tablet, press <span class="ch btn">The chart in hand</span>, the pointing hand, before you pinch.</p><p class="see">Until it is lit, a pinch zooms the page; once it is lit, your fingers move the chart.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span><span class="mark">on a tablet</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--in-hand.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="explorer-places"><h3><span class="rn">vi</span> Places on the chart<span class="gloss">every town opens a card</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="explorer-card">
<span class="num">27</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Click <span class="ch btn">Laukuwelua</span>, the capital.</p><p class="see">Its card opens: when it was founded, the name it once had, and a word of its tongue.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--card.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-view-prospect">
<span class="num">28</span><div class="body"><p class="act">On the card, press <span class="ch btn">View the prospect</span>.</p><p class="see">The Prospect opens: the town engraved side-on, from its own ground.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--view-prospect.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-take-road">
<span class="num">29</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Or press <span class="ch btn">Take the road</span>.</p><p class="see">The Wayfarer's Ribbon unrolls the road from the town.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--take-road.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-lay-prospect">
<span class="num">30</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Or press <span class="ch btn">Lay the prospect on the table</span>.</p><p class="see">The town's prospect is laid on the Chart Table, in the Drawer.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--lay-prospect.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="explorer-press"><h3><span class="rn">vii</span> The Press<span class="gloss">what the sheet can do next, under the chart</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="explorer-verso">
<span class="num">31</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Turn</i> <b>The Sheet</b></span>.</p><p class="see">The chart turns over to its back: the docket, the surveyor's attribution and the office stamp. The press now reads Turn Back, to bring it round again.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--verso.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-to-print">
<span class="num">32</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Take to</i> <b>The Print Room</b></span> to take this world home.</p><p class="see">The Print Room opens with your world on its desk.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--to-print.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-to-journal">
<span class="num">33</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Read the journal in</i> <b>The Reading Room</b></span> to watch it live.</p><p class="see">The Reading Room opens on the same world.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--to-journal.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="explorer-table"><h3><span class="rn">viii</span> The Chart Table<span class="gloss">the sheets you gather, in the Drawer at the right edge</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="explorer-dog-ear">
<span class="num">34</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Draw nearer until the chart is drafted anew, then press the survey's turned-up corner.</p><p class="see">The survey is laid on the Chart Table, and the Drawer's tab counts it.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;cx=0.5000&amp;cy=0.5000&amp;k=1.9600">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--dog-ear.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-drawer">
<span class="num">35</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">The Drawer</span> at the right edge.</p><p class="see">The Chart Table slides out with your sheets on it. It holds up to six.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;cx=0.5000&amp;cy=0.5000&amp;k=1.9600&amp;table=k-s.seed-42.style-antique.legend-1.arms-0.beasts-0.rung-1.lx-8.ly-8">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--drawer.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-to-portfolio">
<span class="num">36</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Take the table to</i> <b>The Portfolio</b></span>.</p><p class="see">The Portfolio opens with every sheet you laid, ready to take home.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;cx=0.5000&amp;cy=0.5000&amp;k=1.9600&amp;table=k-s.seed-42.style-antique.legend-1.arms-0.beasts-0.rung-1.lx-8.ly-8">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--to-portfolio.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step commission" id="explorer-commission">
<span class="num">37</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Your commission: a polar archipelago of about forty islands, of every size, in the nautical style with its arms. Lay one survey of it on the table.</p><p class="see">Then copy the address from the bar. Whoever opens it sees your world, drawn the same, line for line.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;style=nautical&amp;type=archipelago&amp;band=polar&amp;arms=1&amp;islands=40&amp;isleSize=varied">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span><span class="mark comm">a commission</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer--commission.png" alt=""></li></ol></section><p class="next"><a href="#prospect"><i>Next, the steps of</i> <b>The Prospect</b></a></p></section>
<section class="room sub" id="prospect"><h2 id="prospect-h">The Prospect<span class="of">a room of the Explorer</span></h2>
<p class="what">The Prospect is the second camera: one town engraved side-on from its own ground, the way the old printers drew a city. <span class="entered">You come to it from a town's card in the Explorer (View the prospect), from a town's row on the Ribbon, or from the Reading Room.</span></p><section class="lesson" id="prospect-plate"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> A town, engraved<span class="gloss">the plate, and The Engraver's Note at the right</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="prospect-enter">
<span class="num">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">In the Explorer, click a town and press <span class="ch btn">View the prospect</span>.</p><p class="see">The Prospect opens on that town.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/prospect--enter.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="prospect-note">
<span class="num">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Read <span class="ch btn">The engraver's note</span>.</p><p class="see">What the town is, a line of its story, and the key to the numbers on the plate.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/prospect/#seed=42&amp;i=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Prospect at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/prospect--note.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="prospect-year">
<span class="num">3</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Type an earlier year, 300, in <span class="ch btn">viewed in the year</span>, and press <span class="ch btn">Engrave</span>.</p><p class="see">Laukuwelua was founded in 451, so the plate shows its ground before the town rose.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/prospect/#seed=42&amp;i=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Prospect at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/prospect--year.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="prospect-lay">
<span class="num">4</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Lay this prospect on the table</span>.</p><p class="see">It joins the Chart Table, to be taken home in the Portfolio.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/prospect/#seed=42&amp;i=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Prospect at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/prospect--lay.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="prospect-road">
<span class="num">5</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Take the road from Laukuwelua in</i> <b>The Wayfarer's Ribbon</b></span>.</p><p class="see">The Ribbon unrolls the road setting out from this town.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/prospect/#seed=42&amp;i=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Prospect at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/prospect--road.png" alt=""></li></ol></section><p class="next"><a href="#ribbon"><i>Next, the steps of</i> <b>The Wayfarer's Ribbon</b></a></p></section>
<section class="room sub" id="ribbon"><h2 id="ribbon-h">The Wayfarer's Ribbon<span class="of">a room of the Explorer</span></h2>
<p class="what">The Wayfarer's Ribbon unrolls one road as an itinerary: the way drawn league by league up a strip of paper, with a compass turning to keep north true. <span class="entered">You come to it from a town's card in the Explorer (Take the road), from the Prospect, or from a road's row in the Reading Room's Journal.</span></p><section class="lesson" id="ribbon-road"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> A road, unrolled<span class="gloss">the journey at the top right, and The Itinerary below it</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="ribbon-enter">
<span class="num">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">In the Explorer, click a town and press <span class="ch btn">Take the road</span>.</p><p class="see">The road from that town is unrolled strip by strip, each one inked in after the last. With motion turned off, it is all there at once.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/ribbon--enter.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="ribbon-bound-for">
<span class="num">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Choose another town from <span class="ch btn">bound for</span>.</p><p class="see">The road to it is unrolled anew.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/ribbon/#seed=42&amp;a=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Ribbon at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/ribbon--bound-for.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="ribbon-turn-about">
<span class="num">3</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Turn about</span>.</p><p class="see">The road runs the other way: where you were bound, you now set out from.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/ribbon/#seed=42&amp;a=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Ribbon at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/ribbon--turn-about.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="ribbon-lean">
<span class="num">4</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press a row of the itinerary.</p><p class="see">The Glass leans on that stretch of the road, and the chart comes nearer there.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/ribbon/#seed=42&amp;a=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Ribbon at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/ribbon--lean.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="ribbon-pill">
<span class="num">5</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">prospect</span> on a town's row.</p><p class="see">That town's prospect opens.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/ribbon/#seed=42&amp;a=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Ribbon at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/ribbon--pill.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="ribbon-end">
<span class="num">6</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>See Homaitani in</i> <b>The Prospect</b></span>, the road out to the road's end.</p><p class="see">The Prospect of the town the road is bound for.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/ribbon/#seed=42&amp;a=0">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Ribbon at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/ribbon--end.png" alt=""></li></ol></section><p class="next"><a href="#explorer-portfolio"><i>Next, the steps of</i> <b>The Portfolio</b></a></p></section>
<section class="room sub" id="explorer-portfolio"><h2 id="explorer-portfolio-h">The Portfolio<span class="of">a room of the Explorer</span></h2>
<p class="what">The Portfolio is where the sheets you laid on the Chart Table are taken home, each drafted again from the number in its margin. <span class="entered">You come to it from the Drawer in the Explorer (Take the table to The Portfolio), or from the Print Room's note.</span></p><section class="lesson" id="explorer-portfolio-gather"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> Gather, then take home<span class="gloss">the Explorer's Drawer, then this room</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="explorer-portfolio-bare">
<span class="num">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Open the Portfolio with nothing gathered.</p><p class="see">A plate shows the way in three steps: at the Explorer, on the Table, in the Portfolio.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/portfolio/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Portfolio at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer-portfolio--bare.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-portfolio-turn-down">
<span class="num">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">In the Explorer, draw nearer until the chart is drafted anew, and press the survey's turned-up corner.</p><p class="see">The survey is laid on the Chart Table. Lay up to six; the Drawer says when there is no room for more.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;cx=0.5000&amp;cy=0.5000&amp;k=1.9600">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer-portfolio--turn-down.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-portfolio-take">
<span class="num">3</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Open <span class="ch btn">The Drawer</span> and press <span class="ch road"><i>Take the table to</i> <b>The Portfolio</b></span>.</p><p class="see">Every sheet you laid comes here, drafted again from its number.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/#seed=42&amp;cx=0.5000&amp;cy=0.5000&amp;k=1.9600&amp;table=k-s.seed-42.style-antique.legend-1.arms-0.beasts-0.rung-1.lx-8.ly-8">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Explorer at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer-portfolio--take.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-portfolio-next">
<span class="num">4</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Bring up</i> <b>The Next Sheet</b></span>.</p><p class="see">The next sheet comes to the top of the pile.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/portfolio/#table=k-s.seed-42.style-antique.legend-1.arms-0.beasts-0.rung-1.lx-8.ly-8_k-p.seed-42.i-0.style-antique">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Portfolio at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer-portfolio--next.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-portfolio-download">
<span class="num">5</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Download</i> <b>The Engraving</b></span>.</p><p class="see">The sheet on top is saved as the engraving, an SVG that is exact at any size.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/portfolio/#table=k-s.seed-42.style-antique.legend-1.arms-0.beasts-0.rung-1.lx-8.ly-8_k-p.seed-42.i-0.style-antique">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Portfolio at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer-portfolio--download.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="explorer-portfolio-keep">
<span class="num">6</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Copy the address from the bar.</p><p class="see">The table rides in the address, so the link keeps the gathering.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/explorer/portfolio/#table=k-s.seed-42.style-antique.legend-1.arms-0.beasts-0.rung-1.lx-8.ly-8_k-p.seed-42.i-0.style-antique">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Portfolio at this step</span><span class="mark">play: no wrong answer</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/explorer-portfolio--keep.png" alt=""></li></ol></section><p class="next"><a href="#writing-room"><i>Next, the steps of</i> <b>The Writing Room</b></a></p></section>
<section class="room" id="writing-room"><h2 id="writing-room-h">The Writing Room</h2>
<p class="what">The Writing Room founds a world from a sentence: words on its list steer the world, and every other word makes its chart number.</p><section class="lesson" id="writing-room-found"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> A world from a sentence<span class="gloss">the box on The Founding, at the right</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="writing-room-write">
<span class="num">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">In <span class="ch btn">the founding sentence</span> box, write &quot;a polar archipelago of twenty islands&quot;, then press <span class="ch btn">Found</span>.</p><p class="see">A world is founded from your words, and the account below says what each word did.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/writing-room/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Writing Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/writing-room--write.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="writing-room-your-word">
<span class="num">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Add your own name to the end of the sentence, and press <span class="ch btn">Found</span> again.</p><p class="see">Your name is not on the list, so it changes only the chart number: another polar archipelago of about twenty islands.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/writing-room/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Writing Room at this step</span><span class="mark">play: no wrong answer</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/writing-room--your-word.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="writing-room-shape-of">
<span class="num">3</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Write &quot;an island in the shape of Japan&quot;, and press <span class="ch btn">Found</span>.</p><p class="see">The land is drawn in Japan's outline.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/writing-room/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Writing Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/writing-room--shape-of.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="writing-room-plate">
<span class="num">4</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Lay on</i> <b>The Vegetation Plate</b></span>.</p><p class="see">The plants are laid over the land; the press now reads Lift, to take them off.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/writing-room/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Writing Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/writing-room--plate.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="writing-room-explore-it">
<span class="num">5</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Explore it in</i> <b>The Explorer</b></span>.</p><p class="see">Your world opens in the Explorer, its Land and Strand held by your sentence: to change them, write it anew in the Writing Room.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/writing-room/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Writing Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/writing-room--explore-it.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step commission" id="writing-room-commission">
<span class="num">6</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Your commission: write a sentence for a world you would like to visit, and send its link to a friend.</p><p class="see">The same sentence founds the same world, forever.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/writing-room/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Writing Room at this step</span><span class="mark comm">a commission</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/writing-room--commission.png" alt=""></li></ol></section><p class="next"><a href="#reading-room"><i>Next, the steps of</i> <b>The Reading Room</b></a></p></section>
<section class="room" id="reading-room"><h2 id="reading-room-h">The Reading Room</h2>
<p class="what">The Reading Room lets you watch a world live: its founding survey sails first, then its years turn and its towns rise and fall.</p><section class="lesson" id="reading-room-watch"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> Watch a world live<span class="gloss">the instrument under the chart, and the Journal at the right</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="reading-room-play">
<span class="num">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Play</span>.</p><p class="see">The survey ship sails first, day by day; then the years turn, and towns rise and fall. With motion turned off on your computer, Play goes straight to the last year.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/reading-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Reading Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/reading-room--play.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="reading-room-pace">
<span class="num">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">2×</span> or <span class="ch btn">4×</span> to hurry it.</p><p class="see">The voyage and the years run twice or four times as fast. With motion turned off there is no pace to choose, since Play is a still frame.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/reading-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Reading Room at this step</span><span class="mark">with motion on</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/reading-room--pace.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="reading-room-ages">
<span class="num">3</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Drag <span class="ch btn">The ages</span> to any year.</p><p class="see">The chart shows the world as it stood that year, and the line under it tells what happened then.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/reading-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Reading Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/reading-room--ages.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="reading-room-journal">
<span class="num">4</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Read <span class="ch btn">The Journal</span> at the right.</p><p class="see">Each line is a day of the survey, or a year of the ages.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/reading-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Reading Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/reading-room--journal.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="reading-room-this-road">
<span class="num">5</span><div class="body"><p class="act">On a road leg's row in the Journal, press <span class="ch btn">Take this road</span> once the voyage has reached it.</p><p class="see">It asks Leave the voyage? first; then the Wayfarer's Ribbon unrolls that road.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/reading-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Reading Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/reading-room--this-road.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="reading-room-read">
<span class="num">6</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Type a seed and press <span class="ch btn">Read</span>, or press <span class="ch glyph">⚄</span>.</p><p class="see">Another world sits down to be read.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/reading-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Reading Room at this step</span><span class="mark">play: no wrong answer</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/reading-room--read.png" alt=""></li></ol></section><p class="next"><a href="#print-room"><i>Next, the steps of</i> <b>The Print Room</b></a></p></section>
<section class="room" id="print-room"><h2 id="print-room-h">The Print Room</h2>
<p class="what">The Print Room takes a world home: a proof on the desk, a bound atlas of every plate, and posters at four sizes.</p><section class="lesson" id="print-room-proof"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> A proof on the desk<span class="gloss">the seed, the style and Pull a proof, at the top right</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="print-room-pull">
<span class="num">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Type 42 and press <span class="ch btn">Pull a proof</span>.</p><p class="see">The Isle of Rahai comes onto the desk as a proof.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/print-room/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Print Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/print-room--pull.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="print-room-style">
<span class="num">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Choose <span class="ch opt">ink</span> beside it, and pull again.</p><p class="see">The proof is pulled again in pen and ink.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/print-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Print Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/print-room--style.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="print-room-atlas"><h3><span class="rn">ii</span> The Bound Atlas<span class="gloss">the whole atlas, on the sheet at the right</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="print-room-bind">
<span class="num">3</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Bind the atlas</span>.</p><p class="see">In a few seconds every plate is bound from the proof: the chart in every manner, the thematic surveys, the close-ups, the prospect, the road, the banners, the chronicle and the gazetteer.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/print-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Print Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/print-room--bind.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="print-room-turn">
<span class="num">4</span><div class="body"><p class="act">In the Contents, press a thumbnail.</p><p class="see">The sheet on the desk turns to that plate.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/print-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Print Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/print-room--turn.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="print-room-keep">
<span class="num">5</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Print</span> to save the atlas as a PDF, or <span class="ch btn">Download</span> for one file that opens offline.</p><p class="see">Print opens your browser's own Save as PDF, one plate to a page.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/print-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Print Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/print-room--keep.png" alt=""></li></ol></section>
<section class="lesson" id="print-room-posters"><h3><span class="rn">iii</span> Posters<span class="gloss">the presses under the chart</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="print-room-impression">
<span class="num">6</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Choose <span class="ch opt">An impression (PNG)</span>, then press <span class="ch btn">Desk</span>.</p><p class="see">The chart is pressed as a picture 2400 pixels wide, and saved.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/print-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Print Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/print-room--impression.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="print-room-road-plate">
<span class="num">7</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Choose <span class="ch opt">The road from the capital</span> from the first list; the first press now reads <span class="ch btn">Ribbon</span>: press it.</p><p class="see">The road from Laukuwelua is pressed as a plate of its own.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/print-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Print Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/print-room--road-plate.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="print-room-back">
<span class="num">8</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Back to</i> <b>The Explorer</b></span>.</p><p class="see">The Explorer opens on the same world.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/print-room/#seed=42">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Print Room at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/print-room--back.png" alt=""></li></ol></section><p class="next"><a href="#seed-of-the-day"><i>Next, the steps of</i> <b>The Seed of the Day</b></a></p></section>
<section class="room" id="seed-of-the-day"><h2 id="seed-of-the-day-h">The Seed of the Day</h2>
<p class="what">Today draws a new world every day, the same world for everyone, with one forgotten place hidden on it to find.</p><section class="lesson" id="seed-of-the-day-hunt"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> The Daily Hunt<span class="gloss">the notes at the right, and the chart</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="seed-of-the-day-notes">
<span class="num">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Read the survey notes on <span class="ch btn">The Daily Hunt</span>.</p><p class="see">A few lines describe one forgotten place on today's chart. Everyone hunting today looks for the same place.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/seed-of-the-day/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens Today at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/seed-of-the-day--notes.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="seed-of-the-day-sound">
<span class="num">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Click the chart where you think it hides.</p><p class="see">A miss leaves a sounding where you clicked, and a line tells how near you came: hot, warmer, cool or cold.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/seed-of-the-day/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens Today at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/seed-of-the-day--sound.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="seed-of-the-day-share">
<span class="num">3</span><div class="body"><p class="act">When you find it, press <span class="ch btn">Share your find</span>.</p><p class="see">A star is stamped on the place and its story unrolls; the press sends your result, or copies it.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/seed-of-the-day/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens Today at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/seed-of-the-day--share.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="seed-of-the-day-dispatch">
<span class="num">4</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch btn">Draft dispatch</span>.</p><p class="see">Your hunt, every sounding and the star, drawn onto the chart for you to keep.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/seed-of-the-day/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens Today at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/seed-of-the-day--dispatch.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="seed-of-the-day-to-explorer">
<span class="num">5</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press <span class="ch road"><i>Open today's seed in</i> <b>The Explorer</b></span>.</p><p class="see">Today's world, with every control of the Explorer. Come back tomorrow for a new one.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/seed-of-the-day/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens Today at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/seed-of-the-day--to-explorer.png" alt=""></li></ol></section><p class="next"><a href="#gallery"><i>Next, the steps of</i> <b>The Gallery</b></a></p></section>
<section class="room" id="gallery"><h2 id="gallery-h">The Gallery</h2>
<p class="what">The Gallery hangs a dozen worlds for viewing, and every plate is a road into its own world.</p><section class="lesson" id="gallery-browse"><h3><span class="rn">i</span> Worlds hung for viewing<span class="gloss">every plate is a road into its own world</span></h3><ol class="steps"><li class="step" id="gallery-look">
<span class="num">1</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Read the line under a plate.</p><p class="see">Its name, its seed, its kind of land and its climate.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/gallery/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Gallery at this step</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/gallery--look.png" alt=""></li>
<li class="step" id="gallery-open">
<span class="num">2</span><div class="body"><p class="act">Press any plate that catches your eye.</p><p class="see">Its world opens in the Explorer, at its own seed.</p>
<p class="try"><a href="/gallery/">Try it</a><span class="in">opens the Gallery at this step</span><span class="mark">play: no wrong answer</span></p></div>
<img class="pic" src="/round/shots/pictures/gallery--open.png" alt=""></li></ol></section></section><section class="closing" id="afterward"><p class="c-verb">Lean on these</p><h2 class="c-title" id="afterward-h">When the steps are done</h2>
<p class="c-where">for a quicker answer, any time</p>
<p>You may take these steps again whenever you like, from the first. <span class="ch btn">Begin again</span> clears the marks of the steps you have done from this browser, and touches nothing else: your worlds and your Chart Table stay as you left them.</p>
<p>For a quicker answer than a whole ladder, <a href="/faq/">Questions &amp; Answers</a> says how the worlds are made, and <a href="/glossary/">the Glossary</a> says what every word on a chart means.</p>
<p class="c-foot"><a class="again" href="#top">Begin again</a></p></section></div>";}
